                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to sale in large quantities, for resale."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "23b54784-1eb4-3d85-9ae4-b0b37076ab2b",
                                        "entry_id": "77364a48-5d96-3128-908b-5e29736a1c92",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Extensive, indiscriminate, all-encompassing; blanket."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6234de04-34b6-4896-ab51-bfc03cdf5f8c",
                                                "sense_id": "23b54784-1eb4-3d85-9ae4-b0b37076ab2b",
                                                "text": "The bombing resulted in wholesale destruction."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a35be9ed-c1c3-46d8-88c1-0959d3aeade8",
                                                "sense_id": "23b54784-1eb4-3d85-9ae4-b0b37076ab2b",
                                                "text": "But beyond these cut-offs, to avoid the wholesale alteration of all mileposting and mileages—of bridges and culverts, for example—the original mileposts have remained unaltered."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e542415-c39a-4a3d-a193-8484d175c7dd",
                                                "sense_id": "23b54784-1eb4-3d85-9ae4-b0b37076ab2b",
                                                "text": "By wholesale omission of connections and by the use of a microscopic scale of photographic reproduction which makes some of the most important tables difficult to read, the size has been cut down from last winter's 580 to 520 pages only."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d26d211-5f60-4cde-9fc6-a06d36fc615e",
                                                "sense_id": "23b54784-1eb4-3d85-9ae4-b0b37076ab2b",
                                                "text": "With financial losses emerging in 1957, the BTC abandoned the diesel pilot scheme in favour of wholesale orders for untried designs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "wholesale",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8b649ed0-602a-31ad-af52-681603474c87",
                                        "entry_id": "71127570-2e93-3bb0-8cc2-30143b675bd6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In bulk or large quantity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "15f8d279-83ee-3155-a421-52e4c5cb7050",
                                        "entry_id": "71127570-2e93-3bb0-8cc2-30143b675bd6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Indiscriminately."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ba9d6ed-7dca-4446-a0f4-651be1fe19da",
                                                "sense_id": "15f8d279-83ee-3155-a421-52e4c5cb7050",
                                                "text": "It still feels unnerving to some, even those caught in the crossfire, to see injuries invented wholesale and lies accepted by the highest court in the land."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "wholesale",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
